# Editor header title (edit mode)

Match **Apple Shortcuts** edit chrome: back on the left, **title centered**, trailing actions on the right.

## Layout

- Use a **3-column grid** on `.sc-ed-head`: `1fr auto 1fr`.
- Back: column 1, `justify-self: start`.
- Title control: column 2, `justify-self: center`.
- Trailing (save/delete): column 3, `justify-self: end`.

## Title control (required structure)

Center cluster is one **button** (`.sc-ed-title-trigger`), not a bare full-width input:

1. **Tile** (`.sc-ed-title-tile`) — 28×28, rounded; first action icon or Lucide `workflow`.
2. **Label** (`.sc-ed-title-text`) — bold 17px, ellipsis.
3. **Chevron** (`.sc-ed-title-chev`) — Lucide `chevron-down` in a subtle circular hit area.

`aria-haspopup="menu"`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls` on the trigger.

## Menu

- Clicking the **title or chevron** (whole trigger) toggles a **popover below** (`.sc-pop.sc-ed-title-pop`).
- Menu rows: Lucide icon (`.sc-ed-menu-ico`) + label; use existing `sc-smart-menu-inner` styling.
- Default actions: **Rename**, **Duplicate**, separator, **Delete Shortcut** (destructive).
- **Rename**: hide trigger, show centered `#sc-ed-title` input (`.is-renaming` on `.sc-ed-head-center`); blur/Enter commits.
- Close menu on outside click; no hover **transform** on menu rows (background only).

## Icons

- Prefer **embedded Lucide paths** via `SC_LUCIDE_PATHS` / `scInlineLucide()` (same as block icons).
- Do not use emoji or one-off SVG doodles for this header.

## Sync

- `scSyncEditorTitleUI()` updates label, tile, and input from `scEditing` on `scRenderEditor()` and after rename.
- Display name fallback: manual → "New Shortcut"; automation → trigger summary when name empty.
